.TH "Docv::Block" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Block \- A layout unit.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBclass Docv::Block\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
A layout unit. Every block starts on a new line; blocks with the same
indent following each other read as one paragraph with line breaks.
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
